            "detailed_description": "Model ship lovers rejoice again!  This is another collection of six finely-detailed vessels for viewing at both &quot;model&quot; and &quot;actual&quot; size with a VR headset.  Stroll their decks as they sail upon a beautifully-rendered ocean with dynamic day/night cycle.  Remotely control them at model-scale on a park &quot;boating&quot; pond, where you can compete against a &quot;ghost-ship&quot; to capture the most buoys, or pick them up for a closer look.  Each ship includes an &quot;action&quot; event while at sea, whereby mighty cannons fire, ship horns bellow, or the submarine dives.<br><br><strong>Included Ships:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-rate ship of the line: HMS Victory  <br></li><li>Ford class aircraft carrier: USS Gerald R. Ford (CVN-78)  <br></li><li>Research Vessel: RV Calypso  <br></li><li>Ocean liner: RMS Queen Mary 2  <br></li><li>German submarine: U-boat Type VII-C/41 (U-659)  <br></li><li>Icebreaker: USCGC Healy (WAGB-20)  </li></ul><br>Note: this is a standalone experience and does not require Volume 1.<br><br>Get more ships in Volume 1: ",
            "about_the_game": "Model ship lovers rejoice again!  This is another collection of six finely-detailed vessels for viewing at both &quot;model&quot; and &quot;actual&quot; size with a VR headset.  Stroll their decks as they sail upon a beautifully-rendered ocean with dynamic day/night cycle.  Remotely control them at model-scale on a park &quot;boating&quot; pond, where you can compete against a &quot;ghost-ship&quot; to capture the most buoys, or pick them up for a closer look.  Each ship includes an &quot;action&quot; event while at sea, whereby mighty cannons fire, ship horns bellow, or the submarine dives.<br><br><strong>Included Ships:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-rate ship of the line: HMS Victory  <br></li><li>Ford class aircraft carrier: USS Gerald R. Ford (CVN-78)  <br></li><li>Research Vessel: RV Calypso  <br></li><li>Ocean liner: RMS Queen Mary 2  <br></li><li>German submarine: U-boat Type VII-C/41 (U-659)  <br></li><li>Icebreaker: USCGC Healy (WAGB-20)  </li></ul><br>Note: this is a standalone experience and does not require Volume 1.<br><br>Get more ships in Volume 1: ",
